  "bulletin": {
    "id": "1160",
    "issue_date": "2026-06-04T12:15:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-06-04T12:14:28.649Z",
    "meteorologist": "Sanjib Adhikari",
    "analysis_np": "हाल नेपालमा उपल्लो वायुमण्डलमा रहेको पश्चिमी न्युन चापीय रेखा (trough) तथा स्थानीय वायूको आंशिक  प्रभाव रहेको छ ।",
    "analysis_en": "At present, Nepal is under the partial influence of an upper-level western trough and local wind systems.",
    "today_np": "कोशी र मधेश प्रदेश लगायत देशको हिमाली भू-भागमा साधारणतया बादल,  पहाडी भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ र बाँकी तराई भू-भागमा मुख्यतया सफा रहने छ। कोशी प्रदेशको थोरै तथा मधेश र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेश लगायत बागमती, गण्डकी, लुम्बिनी, कर्णाली र सुदुरपश्चिम प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा  हल्का वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना रहेको छ ।",
    "today_en": "Generally cloudy conditions are likely over Koshi Province, Madhesh Province, and the Himalayan region of the country. Partly cloudy conditions are likely over the Hilly region, while mainly fair weather is likely over the remaining Terai regions. There is a possibility of light rainfall/snowfall at a few places in Koshi Province, and at one or two places in Madhesh Province and Sudurpashchim Province, as well as in the Hilly and Himalayan regions of Bagmati, Gandaki, Lumbini, Karnali, and Sudurpashchim Provinces.",
    "tomorrow_np": "कोशी प्रदेश लगायत देशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागमा साधारणतया बादल लाग्नेछ तथा तराई भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ। लुम्बिनी, कर्णाली र सुदुरपश्चिम प्रदेश लगायत देशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका थोरै स्थानहरूमा, मधेश प्रदेश लगायत कोशी, बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना रहेको छ । मधेश र लुम्बिनी प्रदेशका तराई भू-भागका थोरै स्थानहरूमा मध्यम तातो लहर हुनुका साथै कोशी, बागमती, गण्डकी र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशका तराई भू-भागका केही स्थानहरूमा तातो दिन  हुने सम्भावना रहेको छ ।",
    "tomorrow_en": "Generally cloudy conditions are likely over Koshi Province and the Hilly and Himalayan regions of the country, while partly cloudy conditions are likely over the Terai region. There is a possibility of moderate rainfall/snowfall accompanied by thunder and lightning at a few places in Lumbini, Karnali, and Sudurpashchim Provinces, as well as in the Hilly and Himalayan regions of the country, and at one or two places in Madhesh Province and the Terai regions of Koshi, Bagmati, and Gandaki Provinces. In addition, moderate heatwave conditions are likely at a few places in the Terai regions of Madhesh Province and Lumbini Province, while hot day conditions are likely at some places in the Terai regions of Koshi, Bagmati, Gandaki, and Sudurpashchim Provinces.",
    "special": ""
  }
}
